{"server":"cn","storyId":"act30side_level_act30side_02_end","groupId":"act30side","stageId":"act30side_02","title":"同车异图","storyCode":"RS-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"7e6419d61b391b4ba93bb2e8a97e9829490fec2894954de5641494fb93a2648c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"“灰礼帽”尽力阻挡，却不是锏的对手。眼看锏就要找到子爵，列车到站。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"快看，外面能看到雪山！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊这也太近了吧，这是不是谢拉格的圣山？不管是不是，这景色都太美了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发抖的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我说啊，能不能先把窗户关上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发抖的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"风、风有点大，吹得我说话都、都有点不利索了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"也不至于这么夸张吧，我觉得也不是不能忍忍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发抖的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"真的假的，你真的不冷吗？我看你甚至没穿裤子——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"建议你再组织一下语言，再这么说下去我就要告你耍流氓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我穿的这是保暖裤袜，最厚实的那一种！比你那身暖和多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发抖的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟......行行行，你说是，那就是吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。快，你再站过来点，我要拍照了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发抖的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发抖的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你有没有听到什么声音......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士们先生们，日安，日安！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉打扰各位的观光休闲！麻烦各位暂时回到坐席稍作避让，我们——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了这种时候了就别废话了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不住各位，让让，麻烦都让让！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳！这样有点太失礼了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，哎，罗莎琳，轻点拉，我的袖子要被你扯下来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，这是什么谢拉格风俗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也要这样在列车里跑跑看吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发抖的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能有这种风俗吧？感觉好傻，我不干。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不管了，还是先把合照拍了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"看镜头！三......二......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"一......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不讨厌这种追逐游戏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我谈不上喜欢。我们不能坐下来好好谈吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你们自己做贼心虚，一直在跑啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最好继续跑，别停下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，顺便一说，再等五分钟才是外面风景最好的路段，合影可以之后再拍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩得开心点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发抖的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚那又是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发抖的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发抖的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你刚刚说得可能有道理，谢拉格搞不好确实有什么要在列车上疾跑一圈的风俗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发抖的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我们，呃，要不然还是入乡随俗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发抖的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么了，从刚刚起在发什么呆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我的照片，我的照片！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发抖的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"照片怎么了？刚刚那人说再过五分钟风景更好，我看我们还是再等等看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不是说这个！你看这张照片！我正好拍到刚刚那位姐姐的正脸了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我总感觉她看起来有点眼熟，好像在哪见过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"算了不重要！重点是她、她这身正装，未免也太帅了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我要珍藏这张照片！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好客的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来给大家介绍一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好客的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我们谢拉格最有名的奶酪锅，用的是我们当地特产的好奶酪，风味醇厚，保管谢拉格之外的地方都没有这样的滋味！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"真有这么好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快快，再快点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等等，罗莎琳......呃咳咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失礼了女士们先生们，奶酪锅的味道确实不错，我推荐加点胡椒风味更浓——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好客的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好客的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么还来？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"......这就是谢拉格的列车旅行吗，果然如我的朋友们说的那样，别有特色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"呀，加了胡椒果然不错，我喜欢这个味道！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，齐了，抓齐了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"托各位的福，羽兽一只都没少。劳动各位帮忙，真不知道怎么感谢才好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列车员","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生，您可把袋子系紧咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列车员","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次......这次就算了，但您千万记好，我们的列车上是禁止带活物的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列车员","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次记得一定不能再这样了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，一定的，一定的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦、哦哟，小年轻，什么事情这么紧急啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列车员","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"客、客人！列车上请不要这样奔跑！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎！那个戴帽子的家伙！你仔细点......你，哎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要命了，我的羽兽！我的羽兽又跑啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烦恼的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"这个盲盒怎么老是抽不到隐藏限量款！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烦恼的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"最后一次，最后再试一次......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烦恼的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！走路注意点！万一撞坏了我的盲盒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烦恼的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！是、是限量款！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后一节车厢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"追逐游戏结束？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，您赢得了游戏，这看起来已经没有悬念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望我们能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聒噪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的时间不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“灰礼帽”，别着急，我会记得你有这份恳谈的意愿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回头我再单独和你“谈谈”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自己出来，别让我动手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位大姐，姐！我在这呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，呸，地上还挺多灰......美女姐姐，你找我有事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找的不是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是这除了我没别人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（你别乱动！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们在演什么戏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么演戏？没没没有的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哎大叔你安静点！我这不正在替你遮掩呢嘛！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（别、别扯我的头发！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是罗德岛的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我确实是......你知道罗德岛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，美女姐姐，难道你是博士上次来认识的熟人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"熟人？我不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我没有太多时间闲聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我耐心耗尽之前，出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小祖宗，算了算了，快放我出来吧！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能这样帮我确实令我感动，但罗莎琳你下手也太重了点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......我的头发，我的胡子啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于找到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，原来你们认识？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢说相识，不过也曾有过几面之缘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锏女士，许久不见，让您见笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寒暄就不必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克雷加文，山上的老雷昂急着找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老雷昂？找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等会，是老雷昂找我，而不是锏女士您要找我......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我受他所托，来找你。一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他如此着急找我，是有何要事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说来，我好像确实忘了点什么......是什么来着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘了莉莉还在等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对了，是莉莉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么莉莉......不是吧，大叔，你把你相好的忘了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相好——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，咳咳，咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......子爵阁下，您如此行事，恐怕有损维多利亚的形象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尊夫人和令千金如果知道此事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇，人渣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢着！咳咳，该死的灰，不是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莉莉是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"各位乘客，本次列车即将到达终点站——\n银心湖站。\n请各位乘客收拾好随身的行李物品，从各自车厢前后车门有序下车。\n感谢您乘坐本次列车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间耽搁得还不算久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下车后你最好尽快上山去找老雷昂，他很急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还是分道扬镳吧，不然我妈会不高兴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，咳咳，莉莉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——她根本就不是人啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还要骂人家不是人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不不。噗，得了，把我自己气笑了。岔气了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莉莉是驮兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"驮兽......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没说吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“灰礼帽”！你装什么呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不信你手下的探子没把我在谢拉格的行动汇报给你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，您治愈的驮兽叫什么名字，并不在需要我记忆的重点情报之中，阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以，其实大叔不是人渣，也不会有什么危险？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又追又跑的，我以为是什么性命攸关的大事呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......唉！罗莎琳，这确实是事关我名誉的大事啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们想磨蹭多久？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别傻站着，挡路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车到站了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
